{"id":"9cb1e684c866136a","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-strong-normalization.md","title":"Strong Normalization","display":"df-strong-normalization — Strong Normalization","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-strong-normalization","aliases":["72-df-strong-normalization"],"display":"df-strong-normalization — Strong Normalization","depends_on":["[[72-df-normalization-proof]]","[[72-df-transfinite-induction]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998; supplementary primary sources explicitly identified","source_location":"Supplement: Girard–Lafont–Taylor, Proofs and Types (1989), https://www.paultaylor.eu/stable/prot.pdf, ch.6 §§6.1–6.3 print41–45/PDF49–53","verification_status":"definition-contract-checked","proof_status":"local structural construction checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_2026_10_22":"为Newman证明中的逆归约良基归纳给出精确方向"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-strong-normalization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-strong-normalization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-strong-normalization — Strong Normalization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"db757aa1a8cf57f3\" href=\"?note=db757aa1a8cf57f3\" title=\"72-df-normalization-proof\">72-df-normalization-proof</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7a118aa517b30e4d\" href=\"?note=7a118aa517b30e4d\" title=\"72-df-transfinite-induction\">72-df-transfinite-induction</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998; supplementary primary sources explicitly identified"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Supplement: Girard–Lafont–Taylor, Proofs and Types (1989), <a href=\"https://www.paultaylor.eu/stable/prot.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.paultaylor.eu/stable/prot.pdf</a>, ch.6 §§6.1–6.3 print41–45/PDF49–53"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local structural construction checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_2026_10_22","html":"为Newman证明中的逆归约良基归纳给出精确方向"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 是集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq X\\times X\">\\(R\\subseteq X\\times X\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SN}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{SN}_R\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"db757aa1a8cf57f3\" href=\"?note=db757aa1a8cf57f3\" title=\"72-df-normalization-proof\">72-df-normalization-proof</a> 中无无限归约链的定义。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>元理论为ZFC；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WF}\">\\(\\mathrm{WF}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7a118aa517b30e4d\" href=\"?note=7a118aa517b30e4d\" title=\"72-df-transfinite-induction\">72-df-transfinite-induction</a> 的前驱方向定义，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R^{-1}:=\\{\\langle y,x\\rangle:\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\}\">\\(R^{-1}:=\\{\\langle y,x\\rangle:\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SN}(X,R):\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall x\\in X\\ \\operatorname{SN}_R(x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SN}(X,R):\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall x\\in X\\ \\operatorname{SN}_R(x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SN}(X,R)\\longleftrightarrow\\neg\\exists f\\in X^\\omega\\ \\forall n\\in\\omega\\ \\langle f(n),f(n+1)\\rangle\\in R.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SN}(X,R)\\longleftrightarrow\\neg\\exists f\\in X^\\omega\\ \\forall n\\in\\omega\\ \\langle f(n),f(n+1)\\rangle\\in R.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SN}(X,R)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{WF}(X,R^{-1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SN}(X,R)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{WF}(X,R^{-1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>全系统性质量化每个起点；不等同于仅有某条终止策略。</p>\n<p>若逆归约关系良基，则任何无限归约链的值域都是没有极小元的非空子集，矛盾。反向若有非空Y中每点都能沿R再走到Y，依赖选择给Y中的无限归约链，违反SN。故进行归约良基归纳时使用R的逆，而不是把归约箭头方向直接当作前驱方向。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-normalization-proof","status":"resolved","id":"db757aa1a8cf57f3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-normalization-proof]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-transfinite-induction","status":"resolved","id":"7a118aa517b30e4d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-transfinite-induction]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-normalization-proof","status":"resolved","id":"db757aa1a8cf57f3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X$ 是集合，$R\\subseteq X\\times X$；$\\operatorname{SN}_R$ 使用 [[72-df-normalization-proof]] 中无无限归约链的定义。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-transfinite-induction","status":"resolved","id":"7a118aa517b30e4d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"元理论为ZFC；$\\mathrm{WF}$ 取 [[72-df-transfinite-induction]] 的前驱方向定义，$R^{-1}:=\\{\\langle y,x\\rangle:\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq X\\times X","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SN}_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WF}","display":false},{"tex":"R^{-1}:=\\{\\langle y,x\\rangle:\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SN}(X,R):\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall x\\in X\\ \\operatorname{SN}_R(x).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SN}(X,R)\\longleftrightarrow\\neg\\exists f\\in X^\\omega\\ \\forall n\\in\\omega\\ \\langle f(n),f(n+1)\\rangle\\in R.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SN}(X,R)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{WF}(X,R^{-1}).","display":true}],"bytes":1913,"backlinks":[{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-454","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-strong-normalization|df-strong-normalization — Strong Normalization]]"},{"id":"fe827319be301398","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"在ZFC中，$X$ 是集合，$R\\subseteq X^2$。$\\operatorname{SN}(X,R)$、$\\operatorname{Conf}(X,R)$、$\\operatorname{LocalConf}(X,R)$ 分别使用 [[72-df-strong-normalization]] 与 [[72-df-confluence]] 的定义；$R^*\\subseteq X^2$ 取同一载体上的有限反身传递闭包。"}],"outgoing":["db757aa1a8cf57f3","7a118aa517b30e4d"]}